<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<rdf:RDF
   xmlns:owl="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#"
   xmlns:rdf="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#"
   xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#"
>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://example.org/ontology/custom/ww1#State">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="ko">국가</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">State</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">전쟁에 참여할 수 있는 제국, 왕국 또는 공화국 같은 정치 단위이다. 식민지와 자치령은 별도로 구분하지 않는다.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A political unit such as an empire, kingdom or republic that could take part in a war; colonies and dominions are not modelled separately.</rdfs:comment>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://example.org/ontology/custom/ww1#SourceReference">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="ko">출처</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Source reference</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">역사 기록을 확인한 문헌이나 자료의 인용 정보이다. 인용문이 있다는 사실이 내용의 정확성을 보증하지는 않는다.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Citation details of a document or record used to check a historical claim; having a citation does not guarantee accuracy.</rdfs:comment>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://example.org/ontology/custom/ww1#hasParty">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://example.org/ontology/custom/ww1#Agreement"/>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="https://example.org/ontology/custom/ww1#State"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="ko">협정 당사국</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Has party</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">협정에 서명했거나 직접 상대한 주요 당사국을 연결한다. 모든 서명국을 포함한다고 보장하지 않는다.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Links an agreement to a principal party; the recorded parties are not claimed to cover every signatory.</rdfs:comment>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://example.org/ontology/custom/ww1#entryDate">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://example.org/ontology/custom/ww1#Participation"/>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="ko">참전일</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Entry date</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">국가가 전쟁에 들어간 날짜이며 계기 사건의 시작일과 같아야 한다.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">The date on which the state entered the war; it must equal the start date of the triggering event.</rdfs:comment>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://example.org/ontology/custom/ww1#hadCommander">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://example.org/ontology/custom/ww1#Event"/>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="https://example.org/ontology/custom/ww1#Person"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="ko">전투 지휘관</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Had commander</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">전투에서 한 쪽 군을 지휘한 인물을 연결한다. 모든 지휘관을 빠짐없이 기록한다는 뜻은 아니다.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Links a battle to a person who commanded forces in it; the set of commanders is not claimed to be complete.</rdfs:comment>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://example.org/ontology/custom/ww1#governmentForm">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://example.org/ontology/custom/ww1#State"/>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="ko">정체</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Form of government</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">개전 당시 국가의 정체를 empire, kingdom, republic 중 하나로 기록한다.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Records the state's form of government at the outbreak as empire, kingdom or republic.</rdfs:comment>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://example.org/ontology/custom/ww1#conflictStartDate">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://example.org/ontology/custom/ww1#Conflict"/>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="ko">전쟁 시작일</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Conflict start date</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">전쟁이 시작된 것으로 보는 날짜이다.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">The date on which the war is taken to have begun.</rdfs:comment>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://example.org/ontology/custom/ww1#Agreement">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://example.org/ontology/custom/ww1#HistoricalClaim"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="ko">휴전·강화 협정</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Armistice or treaty</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">교전을 멈추는 휴전 협정이나 전쟁 상태를 종결하는 강화 조약이다. 서명일과 당사국을 가진다.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An armistice that halts fighting or a peace treaty that ends the state of war, with a signing date and its principal parties.</rdfs:comment>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://example.org/ontology/custom/ww1#participant">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://example.org/ontology/custom/ww1#Participation"/>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="https://example.org/ontology/custom/ww1#State"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="ko">참전 국가</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Participant</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">참전 기록이 어느 국가의 참전인지 연결한다.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Links a participation record to the state that fought.</rdfs:comment>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://example.org/ontology/custom/ww1#endDate">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://example.org/ontology/custom/ww1#Event"/>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="ko">사건 종료일</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Event end date</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">사건이 끝난 날짜이며 시작일보다 앞설 수 없다.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">The date on which the event ended; it cannot precede the start date.</rdfs:comment>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://example.org/ontology/custom/ww1#exitDate">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://example.org/ontology/custom/ww1#Participation"/>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="ko">전쟁 이탈일</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Exit date</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">국가가 휴전이나 강화로 교전을 마친 날짜이며 협정 서명일과 같아야 한다. 값이 없으면 이탈을 기록하지 않았다는 뜻이다.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">The date on which the state stopped fighting by armistice or treaty; absent when no exit is recorded.</rdfs:comment>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://example.org/ontology/custom/ww1#HistoricalClaim">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="ko">역사 기록 주장</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Historical claim</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">출처로 뒷받침해야 하는 역사적 진술의 상위 개념이다. 참전, 사건, 협정 기록이 이를 구체화한다.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Abstract parent of records that assert a historical statement and should be supported by a cited source.</rdfs:comment>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://example.org/ontology/custom/ww1#Conflict">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="ko">전쟁</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Conflict</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">전체 전쟁의 시작일과 일반 교전 종료일을 가진 범위이다. 법적 종전은 협정 발효일로 따로 기록한다.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Defines a war's scope with its start and general end of fighting; legal termination is recorded separately by treaty force dates.</rdfs:comment>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://example.org/ontology/custom/ww1#birthYear">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://example.org/ontology/custom/ww1#Person"/>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="ko">출생 연도</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Birth year</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">지휘관이 태어난 연도이며 전투 시작 연도보다 늦을 수 없다.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">The year the commander was born; it cannot be later than the year of a battle commanded.</rdfs:comment>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://example.org/ontology/custom/ww1#conflictEndDate">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://example.org/ontology/custom/ww1#Conflict"/>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="ko">교전 종료일</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">End of fighting date</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">전선 전체의 교전이 멈춘 날짜이며 법적으로 전쟁이 끝난 날짜와 다를 수 있다.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">The date on which general fighting stopped, which may differ from the date the war legally ended.</rdfs:comment>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://example.org/ontology/custom/ww1#locationName">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://example.org/ontology/custom/ww1#Event"/>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="ko">장소 이름</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Location name</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">사건이 일어난 장소를 설명하는 이름이며 좌표나 현재 국경은 보증하지 않는다.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A descriptive name of where the event took place, without coordinates or any claim about present borders.</rdfs:comment>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://example.org/ontology/custom/ww1#startDate">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://example.org/ontology/custom/ww1#Event"/>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="ko">사건 시작일</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Event start date</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">사건이 시작된 날짜이다. 하루에 끝난 사건은 종료일과 같다.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">The date on which the event began; it equals the end date for a one-day event.</rdfs:comment>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://example.org/ontology/custom/ww1#servedState">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://example.org/ontology/custom/ww1#Person"/>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="https://example.org/ontology/custom/ww1#State"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="ko">복무 국가</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Served state</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">지휘관이 전쟁 중 군인으로 복무한 국가를 연결한다.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Links a commander to the state in whose forces the person served during the war.</rdfs:comment>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://example.org/ontology/custom/ww1#supportedBy">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://example.org/ontology/custom/ww1#HistoricalClaim"/>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="https://example.org/ontology/custom/ww1#SourceReference"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="ko">뒷받침 출처</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Supported by</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">기록을 확인한 출처를 연결한다. 출처 확인을 마친 기록에만 연결한다.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Links a historical claim to a source consulted to check it; used only once the claim has been source-checked.</rdfs:comment>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://example.org/ontology/custom/ww1#onSide">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://example.org/ontology/custom/ww1#Participation"/>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="https://example.org/ontology/custom/ww1#Side"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="ko">소속 진영</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">On side</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">참전 기간 동안 국가가 속한 진영을 연결한다.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Links a participation record to the side on which the state fought.</rdfs:comment>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://example.org/ontology/custom/ww1#correspondingSide">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://example.org/ontology/custom/ww1#Alliance"/>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="https://example.org/ontology/custom/ww1#Side"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="ko">대응 진영</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Corresponding side</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">개전 전 동맹이 전쟁에서 주로 이어진 진영을 연결한다. 회원국이 실제로 그 진영에 섰다는 뜻은 아니다.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Links a pre-war alliance to the wartime side it chiefly developed into; members did not necessarily join that side.</rdfs:comment>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://example.org/ontology/custom/ww1#signedDate">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://example.org/ontology/custom/ww1#Agreement"/>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="ko">서명일</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Signed date</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">협정이 서명된 날짜이며 발효일과 구분한다.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">The date on which the agreement was signed, as distinct from the date it came into force.</rdfs:comment>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://example.org/ontology/custom/ww1#inTheatre">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://example.org/ontology/custom/ww1#Event"/>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="https://example.org/ontology/custom/ww1#Theatre"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="ko">전선</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">In theatre</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">전투가 벌어진 전선이나 전역을 연결한다.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Links a battle to the theatre in which it was fought.</rdfs:comment>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://example.org/ontology/custom/ww1#hasBelligerent">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://example.org/ontology/custom/ww1#Event"/>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="https://example.org/ontology/custom/ww1#Participation"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="ko">교전 참여</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Has belligerent</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">전투에 병력을 보낸 국가를 참전 기록으로 연결해 진영과 참전 기간을 함께 확인한다. 주요 참전국만 기록하며 모든 참전 부대를 포함한다고 보장하지 않는다.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Links a battle to the participation record of a state that fought in it, so its side and period can be checked; principal contingents only, not every unit that took part.</rdfs:comment>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://example.org/ontology/custom/ww1#Theatre">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="ko">전선·전역</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Theatre</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">서부 전선이나 동부 전선처럼 전투가 벌어진 지리적 구분이다.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A geographic division of the war, such as the Western Front or Eastern Front, in which battles were fought.</rdfs:comment>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://example.org/ontology/custom/ww1#deathYear">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://example.org/ontology/custom/ww1#Person"/>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="ko">사망 연도</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Death year</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">지휘관이 사망한 연도이며 전투 종료 연도보다 앞설 수 없다. 값이 없으면 기록하지 않았다는 뜻이다.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">The year the commander died; it cannot precede the year a commanded battle ended; absent when not recorded.</rdfs:comment>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://example.org/ontology/custom/ww1">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Ontology"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="ko">제1차 세계대전 온톨로지</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">World War I ontology</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">제1차 세계대전의 참전국, 진영, 참전 기간, 주요 사건과 전투, 휴전·강화 협정, 지휘관을 연결하고 각 기록의 출처 확인 상태를 구분한다. 예제는 널리 알려진 사실을 간추린 초안이며 출처 대조 전에는 모두 미확인으로 표시한다.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Connects the participants, sides, periods of participation, key events and battles, armistices and treaties, and commanders of the First World War, and separates each record's source-verification status. The example is a condensed draft of widely known facts and is marked unverified until checked against cited sources.</rdfs:comment>
    <owl:versionIRI rdf:resource="https://example.org/ontology/custom/ww1/0.1.0"/>
    <owl:versionInfo>0.1.0</owl:versionInfo>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://example.org/ontology/custom/ww1#inConflict">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://example.org/ontology/custom/ww1#Participation"/>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="https://example.org/ontology/custom/ww1#Conflict"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="ko">참전한 전쟁</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">In conflict</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">참전 기록이 속한 전쟁을 연결한다.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Links a participation record to the war in which the state fought.</rdfs:comment>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://example.org/ontology/custom/ww1#enteredVia">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://example.org/ontology/custom/ww1#Participation"/>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="https://example.org/ontology/custom/ww1#Event"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="ko">참전 계기 사건</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Entered via</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">국가가 전쟁에 들어가게 된 선전포고, 침공이나 공격 사건을 연결한다.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Links a participation record to the declaration, invasion or attack through which the state entered the war.</rdfs:comment>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://example.org/ontology/custom/ww1#inForceDate">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://example.org/ontology/custom/ww1#Agreement"/>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="ko">발효일</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">In-force date</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">강화 조약이 법적으로 효력을 얻은 날짜이다. 값이 없으면 기록하지 않았다는 뜻이다.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">The date a peace treaty took legal effect; absent when it is not recorded.</rdfs:comment>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://example.org/ontology/custom/ww1#citationText">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://example.org/ontology/custom/ww1#SourceReference"/>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="ko">인용문</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Citation text</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">자료의 저자, 제목, 출판 정보를 담은 사람이 읽을 수 있는 인용 표기이다.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A human-readable citation giving the author, title and publication details of the source.</rdfs:comment>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://example.org/ontology/custom/ww1#Alliance">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="ko">개전 전 동맹</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Pre-war alliance</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">전쟁 발발 전에 맺어진 3국 동맹이나 3국 협상 같은 협력 체제이다. 실제 참전 진영과 다를 수 있다.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A pre-war arrangement such as the Triple Alliance or Triple Entente, whose members may have joined a different side in the war.</rdfs:comment>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://example.org/ontology/custom/ww1#hasMember">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://example.org/ontology/custom/ww1#Alliance"/>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="https://example.org/ontology/custom/ww1#State"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="ko">동맹 회원국</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Has member</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">개전 전 동맹에 속했던 국가를 연결한다.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Links a pre-war alliance to a state that belonged to it.</rdfs:comment>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://example.org/ontology/custom/ww1#verificationStatus">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://example.org/ontology/custom/ww1#HistoricalClaim"/>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="ko">출처 확인 상태</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Verification status</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">unverified는 아직 출처와 대조하지 않았음을, source-checked는 출처를 확인했음을 뜻하며 후자에는 출처가 필요하다.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">unverified means not yet checked against a source; source-checked means checked and requires at least one cited source.</rdfs:comment>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://example.org/ontology/custom/ww1#Side">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="ko">진영</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Side</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">전쟁에서 참전국이 속한 연합국 또는 동맹국 같은 교전 진영이다.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A wartime camp, such as the Allied Powers or the Central Powers, to which a participant belongs.</rdfs:comment>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://example.org/ontology/custom/ww1#Participation">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://example.org/ontology/custom/ww1#HistoricalClaim"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="ko">참전</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Participation</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">한 국가가 한 전쟁에서 특정 진영으로 싸운 기간을 나타낸다. 참전 시작일과 선택적 종료일을 가진다.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Records the period during which one state fought on one side of a war, with an entry date and an optional exit date.</rdfs:comment>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://example.org/ontology/custom/ww1#eventKind">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://example.org/ontology/custom/ww1#Event"/>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="ko">사건 종류</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Event kind</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">assassination, war-declaration, invasion, naval-raid, battle 중 하나이며 필요한 속성이 달라진다.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">One of assassination, war-declaration, invasion, naval-raid or battle, which decides the required properties.</rdfs:comment>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://example.org/ontology/custom/ww1#relatedConflict">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://example.org/ontology/custom/ww1#Event"/>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="https://example.org/ontology/custom/ww1#Conflict"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="ko">관련 전쟁</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Related conflict</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">사건이 속하거나 전쟁의 계기가 된 전쟁을 연결한다.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Links an event to the war it belongs to or precipitated.</rdfs:comment>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://example.org/ontology/custom/ww1#directedAgainst">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://example.org/ontology/custom/ww1#Event"/>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="https://example.org/ontology/custom/ww1#State"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="ko">상대국</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Directed against</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">선전포고, 침공이나 공격의 대상이 된 국가를 연결한다.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Links a war declaration, invasion or raid to the state it targeted.</rdfs:comment>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://example.org/ontology/custom/ww1#agreementKind">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://example.org/ontology/custom/ww1#Agreement"/>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="ko">협정 종류</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Agreement kind</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">교전만 멈추는 armistice인지 전쟁 상태를 끝내는 peace-treaty인지 구분한다.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Distinguishes an armistice, which only halts fighting, from a peace-treaty, which ends the state of war.</rdfs:comment>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://example.org/ontology/custom/ww1#endedByAgreement">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://example.org/ontology/custom/ww1#Participation"/>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="https://example.org/ontology/custom/ww1#Agreement"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="ko">참전을 끝낸 협정</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Ended by agreement</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">국가의 교전을 끝낸 휴전 협정이나 강화 조약을 연결한다.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Links a participation record to the armistice or treaty that ended the state's fighting.</rdfs:comment>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://example.org/ontology/custom/ww1#outcome">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://example.org/ontology/custom/ww1#Event"/>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="ko">전투 결과</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Battle outcome</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">전투 결과를 allied-victory, central-victory, contested 중 하나로 기록한다. 평가가 갈리면 contested를 사용한다.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Records a battle's outcome as allied-victory, central-victory or contested, the last when historians disagree.</rdfs:comment>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://example.org/ontology/custom/ww1#initiatedBy">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://example.org/ontology/custom/ww1#Event"/>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="https://example.org/ontology/custom/ww1#State"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="ko">행위국</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Initiated by</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">선전포고, 침공이나 공격을 먼저 한 국가를 연결한다.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Links a war declaration, invasion or raid to the state that carried it out.</rdfs:comment>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://example.org/ontology/custom/ww1#Person">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="ko">지휘관</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Commander</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">전투를 지휘한 인물이다. 복무한 국가와 생존 연도만 기록하고 직책 이력은 다루지 않는다.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A person who commanded forces in a battle; only the served state and lifespan are recorded, not a career history.</rdfs:comment>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://example.org/ontology/custom/ww1#sourceUri">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://example.org/ontology/custom/ww1#SourceReference"/>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#anyURI"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="ko">출처 주소</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Source URI</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">출처를 열람할 수 있는 위치이며 문서의 진위나 접근 가능성을 자동으로 보증하지 않는다.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Where the source can be consulted; it does not by itself guarantee authenticity or availability.</rdfs:comment>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://example.org/ontology/custom/ww1#Event">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://example.org/ontology/custom/ww1#HistoricalClaim"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="ko">사건</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Event</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">암살, 선전포고, 침공, 해상 공격이나 전투처럼 날짜 범위를 가진 역사적 사건이다. 종류에 따라 필요한 정보가 달라진다.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A dated historical occurrence such as an assassination, war declaration, invasion, naval raid or battle; its kind decides which details apply.</rdfs:comment>
  </rdf:Description>
</rdf:RDF>
